PART 5 -- second-derivative bound (G3): 0<=R''(z)<=2R(z)/(1+z^2)<=2/(z(1+z^2))<=2/z^3
==============================================================================
R''(z) = R(z) + z*R'(z) [via R'=zR-1] = z*(z*R(z) - 1) + R(z)
R(z)*(1+z^2) - z  matches? residual = 0
d/ds[1/(1+s^2)^2] = -4*s/(s**2 + 1)**3  (negative for s>0 => decreasing, confirms sup-at-s=z step)

Algebraic chain: R''(z) = (1+z^2)*w1(z) <= (1+z^2)*2R(z)/(1+z^2)^2 = 2R(z)/(1+z^2)
                        <= 2*(1/z)/(1+z^2) = 2/(z(1+z^2)) <= 2/z^3

